 diseases such as cancer, renal insufficiency, liver disease, and conditions like dysphagia, which hinder proper nutrient intake.\n\nIn cancer patients, malnutrition is a common diagnosis, affecting approximately 80% of those with advanced gastric cancer and leading to poor health outcomes and increased mortality rates. It can also complicate recovery in patients undergoing surgical procedures and those receiving treatments like hematopoietic cell transplantation. Nutritional deficiencies in these patients can result in a weakened immune response, prolonged hospital stays, and a greater risk of complications.\n\nMalnutrition is not limited to cancer patients; it is also a critical issue among the elderly, particularly those in palliative care, where it can lead to functional and social incapacity. In geriatric patients, malnutrition may necessitate nutritional support interventions to improve health outcomes. Additionally, malnutrition can occur in patients with chronic kidney disease, liver disease, and other conditions, often requiring specialized dietary considerations and interventions, such as parenteral nutrition.\n\nOverall, malnutrition encompasses both undernutrition and overnutrition, affecting health and well-being across various populations. It is essential to recognize and address malnutrition through appropriate nutritional assessments and interventions to enhance recovery and quality of life for affected individuals.", "ÍNDICE DE MASA CORPORAL (IMC):The Índice de Masa Corporal (IMC), known in English as Body Mass Index (BMI), is a metric utilized to evaluate body weight in relation to height. It serves as a tool in nutritional assessments and is instrumental in classifying individuals into various weight categories based on their weight relative to their height. This classification helps in understanding an individual's body composition and potential health risks associated with different weight statuses.", "CAPACIDAD FUNCIONAL:Functional capacity refers to a patient's ability to perform daily activities, which can impact nutritional status.", "SÍNTOMAS GASTROINTESTINALES:The entity \"Síntomas Gastrointestinales\" encompasses a range of gastrointestinal symptoms that are commonly observed in individuals with various conditions, including celiac disease, gluten sensitivity, and lactose intolerance. These symptoms include bloating, diarrhea, nausea, and vomiting, which can significantly impair a patient's ability to maintain proper nutrition. In patients with celiac disease, clinical manifestations may include chronic diarrhea and abdominal distension. Additionally, gastrointestinal symptoms are also noted in patients with MELAS, where they contribute to an increased risk of malnutrition. Overall, these symptoms are critical factors that are assessed during evaluations to understand their impact on nutritional health.", "CAMBIOS EN LA INGESTA DIETÉTICA:Changes in dietary intake can affect nutritional status and are important to assess in evaluations.", "ESTRÉS PSICOLÓGICO:Psychological stress can impact a patient's nutritional intake and overall health, making it a relevant factor in assessments.", "VALORACIÓN SUBJETIVA GLOBAL GENERADA POR EL PACIENTE:Método de evaluación del estado nutricional del paciente basado en su percepción", "ALIMENTACIÓN RESPECTO HACE 1 MES:Evaluación de los cambios en la alimentación del paciente en el último mes", "ACTIVIDAD COTIDIANA:Descripción de la actividad diaria del paciente en el último mes", "EXPLORACIÓN CLÍNICA:Evaluación física del paciente para determinar el estado de salud y nutrición", "EDEMAS/ASCITIS:Condiciones que pueden afectar el estado nutricional y la salud del paciente", "DIFICULTADES PARA ALIMENTARSE:", "FÓRMULA DE CHUMLEA:The Chumlea formula is used to estimate height based on the measurement of the heel-knee distance, aiding in nutritional assessment.", "FÓRMULA DE RABITO:The Rabito formula is used to estimate weight based on arm and abdominal circumference, contributing to nutritional evaluation.", "EDMAS/ASCITIS:"], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}